# Project core

## Priorities
- Accuracy over volume.
- Implemented ≠ verified. GREEN requires measured evidence.
- Official NCERT > NTA > verified project data > external sources (only when a task explicitly requires the latter).

## Source honesty
- Never silently invent, replace, or reconcile source material.
- Never silently upgrade provenance.
- Never treat model knowledge as syllabus or NCERT authority.

## Change posture
- High-risk work: inspect → execute → verify → audit.
- Prefer surgical, idempotent mutations over broad rewrites.
- Repository rules + measured audit artifacts beat prompt memory.
